Package: camserv
Version: 0.9.0-rc1
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: CAMserv Engineering Team <eng@camserv.it>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pip, python3-venv, ffmpeg, libgl1, libglib2.0-0, sqlite3, libcap2-bin, systemd
Recommends: v4l-utils, onvif-tools, openvino-bin
Homepage: https://github.com/aboulouafaeit-sys/CAMserv.IT
Description: CAMserv — Privacy-First Security Intelligence & NVR Appliance Platform
 CAMserv is an enterprise-grade, privacy-first Video Surveillance, NVR,
 and Security Intelligence platform designed for mission-critical edge appliances.
 Features continuous segmentation, RAM pre-roll buffers, tripwires, loitering timers,
 Ed25519 digital forensics, and federated central synchronization.
